 .../MainWindow.axaml.cs                       |  3 ++-
 launcher/Shared/LauncherUpdate.cs             |  4 +++-
 tools/package-launcher.py                     | 21 ++++++++++++-------
 5 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

